Tokenizer vocabulary (third-party data)
---------------------------------------

review-mcp links the Go module tiktoken-go/tokenizer (MIT License, see
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES), which embeds the o200k_base byte-pair-encoding
vocabulary as Go data. That module generates the vocabulary from the file
published by OpenAI at
https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/encodings/o200k_base.tiktoken
(see internal/cmd/vocab.go in the module). The module's MIT license covers
its own code; it does not state a license for the vocabulary data, which
originates from OpenAI's tiktoken project (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022
OpenAI, Shantanu Jain). The vocabulary is used only to estimate token counts.
